@startuml
actor Admin
actor Customer
participant "Admin UI" as AUI
participant "Product Controller" as PC
participant "Shop Product Controller" as SPC
database DB

Admin -> AUI: تعديل حالة المنتج
AUI -> PC: PUT is_active=false
PC -> DB: update product

Customer -> SPC: فتح صفحة المنتجات
SPC -> DB: select where is_active=true
DB --> SPC: active products
SPC --> Customer: عرض المنتجات
@enduml
